t":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.44,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.7,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"toothache","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":1,"lift":1.63,"evidence_tier":"sparse"},{"concept_id":"uterine_disorders","dsc":1,"cul":0,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":4,"lift":1.66,"evidence_tier":"sparse"}],"lead_score":0.5692},"texts":{"dsc:3.31":{"ref":"De materia medica 3.31","headword":"γλήχων","lang":"grc","source":"dioscorides","text":"γλήχων· πόα γνώριμος, θερμαντική, λεπτυντική, πεπτική. ποθεῖσα δὲ ἔμμηνα καὶ δεύτερα καὶ ἔμβρυα ἄγει· ἀνάγει δὲ καὶ τὰ ἐκ πνεύμονος μεθʼ ἁλὸς καὶ μέλιτος ποθεῖσα καὶ σπωμένοις βοηθεῖ, ναυσίας τε καὶ δηγμούς στομάχου μετʼ ὀξυκράτου ποθεῖσα παραμυθεῖται· ἄγει δὲ καὶ κατὰ κοιλίαν μέλανα, βοηθεῖ καὶ θηριοδήκτοις μετʼ οἴνου πινομένη, λειποθυμοῦντάς τε ἀνακτᾶται σύν ὄξει ταῖς ῥισὶ προσαγομένη. κρατύνει 2 δὲ καὶ οὖλα ξηρά λεία κεκαυμένη, ἐπιπλασθεῖσα δὲ πραΰνει πᾶσαν φλεγμονὴν σὺν ἀλφίτῳ, καθʼ ἑαυτὴν δὲ ποδαγρικοῖς ἁρμόζει ἄχρι φοινίξεως τῆς ἐπιφανείας, σὺν κηρωτῇ δὲ ἰόνθους σβέννυσιν ὠφελεῖ δὲ καὶ σπληνικούς μεθʼ ἁλὸς καταπλασσομένη. τὸ δὲ ἀφέψημα αὐτῆς κνησμούς λουόμενον παύει καὶ εἰς ἐγκάθισμα πρὸς ἐμπνευματώσεις καὶ σκληρίας καὶ ἀποστροφὰς ὑστέρας ἁρμόζει. καλοῦσι δέ τινες αὐτὴν βλήχωνα, ἐπειδὴ κατὰ τὴν ἄνθησιν τὰ γευσάμενα τῶν ποιμνίων βληχῆς ὑποπίμπλαται.","spans":[{"start":66,"end":100,"concept_id":"amenorrhea","polarity":"action"},{"start":102,"end":129,"concept_id":"cough","polarity":"action"},{"start":166,"end":172,"concept_id":"convulsions","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":184,"end":191,"concept_id":"nausea_vomiting","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":199,"end":213,"concept_id":"dyspepsia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":265,"end":277,"concept_id":"constipation","polarity":"action"},{"start":297,"end":306,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":331,"end":339,"concept_id":"heart","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":409,"end":413,"concept_id":"mouth_gums","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":465,"end":472,"concept_id":"inflammation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":502,"end":508,"concept_id":"gout","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":567,"end":571,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":599,"end":609,"concept_id":"spleen_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":656,"end":661,"concept_id":"itch_scabies","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":704,"end":715,"concept_id":"flatulence","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":747,"end":754,"concept_id":"uterine_disorders","polarity":"therapeutic"}]},"cul:231-pennyroyal":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Pennyroyal","headword":"Pennyroyal","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"The herb is under Venus. Dioscorides saith, that Pennyroyal makes thin tough phlegm, warms the coldness of any part whereto it is applied, and digests raw or corrupt matter; Being boiled and drank, it provokes women’s courses, and expels the dead child and after-birth, and stays the disposition to vomit, being taken in water and vinegar mingled together. And being mingled with honey and salt, it voids phlegm out of the lungs, and purges melancholy by the stool. Drank with wine, it helps such as are bitten and stung with venomous beasts, and applied to the nostrils with vinegar, revives those that are fainting and swooning. Being dried and burnt, it strengthens the gums. It is helpful to those that are troubled with the gout, being applied of itself to the place until it was red; and applied in a plaister, it takes away spots or marks in the face; applied with salt, it profits those that are splenetic, or livergrown. The decoction doth help the itch, if washed therewith. The green herb bruised and put into vinegar, cleanses foul ulcers, and takes away the marks of bruises and blows about the eyes, and all discolourings of the face by fire, yea, and the leprosy, being drank and outwardly applied: Boiled in wine with honey and salt, it helps the tooth-ache. It helps the cold griefs by the joints, taking away the pains, and warms the cold part, being fast bound to the place, after a bathing or sweating in a hot house. Pliny adds, that Pennyroyal and Mints together, help faintings, being put into vinegar, and smelled unto, or put into the nostrils or mouth. It eases head-aches, pains of the breast and belly, and gnawings of the stomach; applied with honey, salt, and vinegar, it helps cramps or convulsions of the sinews: Boiled in milk, and drank, it is effectual for the cough, and for ulcers and sores in the mouth; drank in wine it provokes women’s courses, and expels the dead child, and after-birth. Matthiolus saith, The decoction thereof being drank, helps the jaundice and dropsy, all pains of the head and sinews that come of a cold cause, and clears the eye-sight. It helps the lethargy, and applied with barley-meal, helps burnings; and put into the ears, eases the pains of them.","spans":[{"start":201,"end":225,"concept_id":"amenorrhea","polarity":"action"},{"start":242,"end":252,"concept_id":"labor","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":257,"end":268,"concept_id":"labor","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":284,"end":304,"concept_id":"nausea_vomiting","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":405,"end":428,"concept_id":"cough","polarity":"action"},{"start":434,"end":451,"concept_id":"constipation","polarity":"action"},{"start":504,"end":510,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":515,"end":520,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":526,"end":534,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":608,"end":616,"concept_id":"heart","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":621,"end":629,"concept_id":"heart","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":673,"end":677,"concept_id":"mouth_gums","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":729,"end":733,"concept_id":"gout","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":831,"end":836,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":904,"end":913,"concept_id":"spleen_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":918,"end":928,"concept_id":"liver_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":958,"end":962,"concept_id":"itch_scabies","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1044,"end":1050,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1080,"end":1087,"concept_id":"bruises","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1122,"end":1135,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1170,"end":1177,"concept_id":"scaly_skin","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1263,"end":1273,"concept_id":"toothache","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1293,"end":1313,"concept_id":"joint_pain","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1331,"end":1336,"concept_id":"pain","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1491,"end":1500,"concept_id":"heart","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1588,"end":1598,"concept_id":"headache","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1635,"end":1658,"concept_id":"dyspepsia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1708,"end":1714,"concept_id":"convulsions","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1718,"end":1729,"concept_id":"convulsions","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1796,"end":1801,"concept_id":"cough","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1811,"end":1840,"concept_id":"mouth_gums","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1859,"end":1883,"concept_id":"amenorrhea","polarity":"action"},{"start":1900,"end":1910,"concept_id":"labor","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1916,"end":1927,"concept_id":"labor","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1992,"end":2000,"concept_id":"jaundice","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":2005,"end":2011,"concept_id":"edema_dropsy","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":2017,"end":2034,"concept_id":"headache","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":2077,"end":2097,"concept_id":"eye_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":2112,"end":2120,"concept_id":"delirium","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":2158,"end":2166,"concept_id":"burns","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":2176,"end":2206,"concept_id":"ear_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"images":["glekhon-87r-dioscoride-vienne"]}